WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.445
After a meeting or a closed claim, “Ask for feedback”

2
00:00:03.445 --> 00:00:05.372
prepares a short message with the link.

3
00:00:05.674 --> 00:00:07.729
One question, from zero to ten.

4
00:00:07.973 --> 00:00:10.306
Prepared here, sent by you.

5
00:00:11.406 --> 00:00:14.470
The survey page is served by the AVRASTRO platform,

6
00:00:14.529 --> 00:00:19.079
so sign in to your account first, in System, “Account”.

7
00:00:20.179 --> 00:00:24.009
With a nine or ten, a draft asking for a Google review is prepared,

8
00:00:24.138 --> 00:00:26.215
with the review link you set in Settings.

9
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.200
With zero to six, a call-back task is created,

10
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.475
so you talk to the client.

11
00:00:32.575 --> 00:00:34.978
In “Growth analytics”, the “Client feedback”

12
00:00:34.978 --> 00:00:38.785
chart shows NPS per month, NPS over the last twelve months,

13
00:00:38.879 --> 00:00:41.177
the answers and what share answered.

14
00:00:42.277 --> 00:00:45.062
You get the review link from your Google Business Profile,

15
00:00:45.121 --> 00:00:48.383
“Ask for reviews”, and enter it in Settings;

16
00:00:48.628 --> 00:00:51.111
it must start with https.

17
00:00:52.211 --> 00:00:53.359
In the next lesson:

18
00:00:53.604 --> 00:00:56.076
the KYC and AML file.
